<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Swiss insurance basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Swiss insurance basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued two million American-style call warrants on a basket of Swiss insurance shares, lead maanger SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of two Swiss Reinsurance Co shares, three Winterthur Schweizerische Versicherungs-Gesellschaft shares and seven Zurich Reinsurance Centre. One basket is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,000 CHF		PREMIUM	12.21 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.43 CHF		  GEARING	9.10 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.APR.99		 PAYDATE	07.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 200</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  9,880 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
